description:
Finds the quotes and notes in the reader's ReadingRate collection that are closest in meaning to one of their saved quotes or notes, across all their books, with each passage's book, author, page and a similarity score from 0 to 1.

Use when the reader asks what else they have saved that connects to a particular quote or note, or for related passages in their collection. Get the id from list_saved_quotes (a quote) or get_reading_notes (a note).

Examples:
- {"id": "<quote id>", "type": "quote"}
- {"id": "<note id>", "limit": 10, "threshold": 0.35}
